{"availability":"available","full":"thetahealth/mirobody","name":"mirobody","description":"Turn scattered health data into answers you can trace. Self-hosted AI health data engine for lab reports, wearables and genetics, with a built-in MCP server. Run it with Docker and one LLM key, or keep every model local on llama.cpp.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":1374,"forks":241,"created":"2025-11-29T06:55:46Z","updated":"2026-10-15T11:47:11Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://mirobody.ai/","topics":["ai-agents","apple-health","digital-health","genetic-data","genomics","health","health-data","healthcare-ai","icpc-3","lab-reports","lab-results","llama-cpp","loinc","mcp-server","medical-records","personal-health-record","python","quantified-self","self-hosted","wearables"],"demo":"https://chat.mirobody.ai/demo?ref=github-readme&lang=en","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:33.714Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:33.714Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T21:46:33.714Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:32:23.727Z","stars":1358,"forks":238},{"at":"2026-10-07T23:29:38.319Z","stars":1360,"forks":240},{"at":"2026-10-10T01:07:51.315Z","stars":1368,"forks":240},{"at":"2026-10-15T21:46:33.714Z","stars":1374,"forks":241}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Turn scattered health data into answers you can trace.","A self-hosted AI health data engine that brings lab reports, wearables and genetic files into one standardized record.","Standardize health data with one command. Try the full app in Codespaces with your own model key, or run the app, the data and the models 100% on your own machine."],"features":["Compare reports across labs. PDFs, phone photos and spreadsheets, 23 file types in all, land in one history. Every reading links to the page it was read from.","Bring in everyday data. Import an Apple Health export, or connect Garmin, Oura and Whoop.","